---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<section class="intro">
  <h1>Hi, I'm <span class="scribble">Jeff.<svg viewBox="0 0 100 12" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5C20 4 45 2.2 64 4.6c14 1.8 22 4.2 33 1.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg></span></h1>
  <p>{{ site.tagline }} I write about what I've built, what broke, and what I'd do differently.</p>
  <a class="status" href="/about/">Open to engineering leadership roles</a>
</section>

<h2 class="section-label">Writing</h2>
<ul class="post-list">
  {%- for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
    <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
    {%- if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
